Z||000000||CUTTER||05-31-2000||01:43 AM||||Well, my friend in his 94-97 Integra GS-R with a V-Tech wants to drag race me. I fooled around with him before and I pulled away, but Im afraid of him beating me this time 0-80mph, His car is stock and I have a 87GT auto with a flowmaster, accell wires and a K&N air filter. just a few months ago I got a tranny outa a 84 pontiac 6000, what do you think my odds of winning will be? How are the 84 6000 trannys compared to the 87GT 3spd auto trannys?<P>Shane, 87GT||||reg||2
Z||000001||sid1200||05-31-2000||02:47 AM||||is his GSR an auto or stick.<P>really shouldn't matter though a GSR is faster than a GT auto either way, esp 0-80.  so I wouldn't do it, unless he doens't know how to drive and has a stick shift, ie, not willing to rev the engine, a must in the GSR's||||reg||1
